ssbook><name>WALKER TOBY</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUBARA, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SONY CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WALKER, TOBY</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUBARA HIROSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>WALKER TOBY</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUBARA, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>WALKER, TOBY</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A descriptor serving as a unit element for defining a describing method for describing feature data expressing the feature of the content of video data has a structure where attribute serving as lower-order elements are defined and is composed by a description format capable of containing another descriptor as attributes. That is, the description format of the descriptor includes a descriptor of a lower-order element or a feature representing an attribute and a feature type representing the data type of the feature.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention se rapporte à un descripteur mis en oeuvre en tant qu'élément unitaire pour définir un procédé permettant de décrire les données caractéristiques exprimant la particularité du contenu de données vidéo. Ce descripteur possède une structure dans laquelle les attributs utilisés en tant qu'éléments d'ordre inférieur sont définis et qui est composée d'un format de description susceptible de contenir un autre descripteur en tant qu'attributs. Le format de description du descripteur comprend de ce fait un descripteur d'un élément d'ordre inférieur ou une caractéristique représentant un attribut et un type de caractéristique représentant le type de données de la caractéristique.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>